{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "fa37f996-cde2-4bf8-b6ec-19b1dbc38bd5",
    "name": "Mobile1",
    "description": "Complete Postman collection for the unite-mobile1 BFF (mobile1api), targeting QC4.\r\n\r\nUSAGE:\r\n1. Select the 'unite-mobile1 QC4' environment.\r\n2. Run '00 - Auth > Login (mobilemembersession)' â€” stores {{jwtToken}}, {{sessionId}}, {{memberId}}.\r\n3. Run remaining folders in order for dynamic chaining (ext from mobileprofilemenu, ownerPutBody from mobileowner).\r\n\r\nScanned from JAX-RS @Path resources in unite-mobile1. DELETE and session logout PATCH are documented but not run in QC verification.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "48289834"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 - Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (mobilemembersession)",
          "event": [
            {
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login: status is 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var item = (pm.response.json()._embedded || {}).item || {};",
                  "pm.test('Login: jwtToken present', function () { pm.expect(item.jwtToken, 'jwtToken').to.be.a('string').and.to.have.length.above(0); });",
                  "if (item.jwtToken) { pm.environment.set('jwtToken', item.jwtToken); }",
                  "if (item.idpJwtToken) { pm.environment.set('idpJwtToken', item.idpJwtToken); }",
                  "if (item.memberId) { pm.environment.set('memberId', item.memberId); }",
                  "if (item.id) { pm.environment.set('sessionId', item.id); }",
                  "if (item.planId) { pm.environment.set('planId', item.planId); }"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              },
              "listen": "test"
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-App-Version",
                "value": "{{appVersion}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\r\n    \"planId\": \"{{planId}}\",\r\n    \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\r\n    \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\r\n    \"rememberMe\": {{rememberMe}},\r\n    \"deviceUuid\": null\r\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/{{apiApp}}/{{apiVer}}/mobilemembersession",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "{{apiApp}}",
                "{{apiVer}}",
                "mobilemembersession"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Member login. Captures jwtToken, memberId, sessionId."
          },
          "response": []
        },
